TGA cards are PCI and come in approximately 4 variants
{8bit,32bit}{TGA,TGA2}.  The XalphaNetBSD server supports
these cards and requires no configuration.

The XalphaNetBSD server is an offshoot of the MIT X server,
and not of XF86.

